data: {"content": "滞损耗（Hysteresis Loss）\",\n      \"plain_description\": \"把一块铁放", "total_length": 2709}

event: text
data: {"content": "进一个来回变化的磁场里，", "total_length": 2721}

event: text
data: {"content": "铁会被反复磁化和去磁。你可能", "total_length": 2735}

event: text
data: {"content": "以为这个过程是完全可逆的——磁场推", "total_length": 2752}

event: text
data: {"content": "过去，铁磁化；磁场撤掉，铁回到原样", "total_length": 2769}

event: text
data: {"content": "。但实际上不是这样。铁内部有无数个", "total_length": 2786}

event: text
data: {"content": "叫「磁畴」的小区域，每个磁畴就像一个小指", "total_length": 2806}

event: text
data: {"content": "南针，平时指向乱七八糟的方向。外", "total_length": 2822}

event: text
data: {"content": "部磁场来了，这些小指南针会费力地转向对", "total_length": 2841}

event: text
data: {"content": "齐；磁场撤了，它们不会完全转回去", "total_length": 2857}

event: text
data: {"content": "——因为转动过程中有「内", "total_length": 2869}

event: text
data: {"content": "部摩擦」，就像弹簧门的铰链有阻力一", "total_length": 2886}

event: text
data: {"content": "样。结果是：磁场来回走一圈，铁的磁化状", "total_length": 2905}

event: text
data: {"content": "态走的路径是一个封闭的「回路」，但", "total_length": 2922}

event: text
data: {"content": "去程和回程不重合，围成了一个面", "total_length": 2937}

event: text
data: {"content": "积。这个面积就是每个周期白白", "total_length": 2951}

event: text
data: {"content": "损耗掉的能量，变成热散掉了。", "total_length": 2965}

event: text
data: {"content": "工程师把这个回路叫「磁滞回线", "total_length": 2979}

event: text
data: {"content": "」，回线越宽，每次循环损耗越大。软", "total_length": 2996}

event: text
data: {"content": "磁材料（如硅钢）回线很窄，损耗小，适", "total_length": 3014}

event: text
